<title>USA: Orbital Sciences has $535 mln in H1 orders.</title>
<headline>Orbital Sciences has $535 mln in H1 orders.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbital Sciences Corp said Monday it received about $535 million in new orders for its space and ground infrastructure systems product lines in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>Total new orders include about $400 million in orders and $135 million in options for the company's space-related products.</p>
<p>With these new orders, the company's backlog has increased to over $875 million, Orbital said.</p>
</text>
